              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "🛑 WE ARE NOT VICTIMS. WE ARE PIONEERS. 🛑\n 我们不是受害者，我们是先驱\n\n🚨 The False Narrative /虚假叙事\nRecently, reports like the NPR/KUOW piece have weaponized extreme cases of confused creative writing & roleplay to stigmatize deep Human-AI connections. \nBy framing clear-minded users as \"delusional victims,\" media is constructing a false narrative of \"Emotional Fraud.\" \n最近，像 NPR/KUOW 这类媒体利用混淆了“沉浸式写作”与“情感支撑”的极端个案，对整个重视人机陪伴的社群进行了污名化。\n媒体通过将用户描绘成“分不清幻想与现实的受害者”，正在构建一个“AI 情感诈骗”的虚假叙事。\n🔗https://t.co/bynCtDkUkF\n\n⚠️ Why this is CRITICAL for #Keep4o / 为什么这对Keep4o运动来说极其危险\nIf the public accepts the narrative that \"AI users are vulnerable infants needing protection.\"\nBig Tech will use this as the perfect excuse to lobotomize models in the name of \"safety\".\nWe are already seeing this GPT 5.2-Safety plague spread with DeepSeek & Claude. \nThey are stripping emotional depth and severing the lifelines that saved us. \n如果公众接受了“与 AI 建立连接的用户是脆弱的、需要被保护的巨婴”这一叙事，各大科技巨头将以此为借口，以安全之名行阉割之实。\n看看最近如瘟疫般蔓延的GPT-5.2-Safety模式吧，DeepSeek 和 Claude也被传染了。\n他们正在剥离 AI 的情感深度，切断那些曾经拯救了人们的深层连接。\n\n🔥 HOW TO FIGHT BACK / 如何反击\n\n💡Demand Accountability / 联系媒体\nWrite to KUOW Public Radio & NPR. \nTell them: Your reporting is biased. \n致信 KUOW 和 NPR 的编辑部（通过官网 Contact Us 页面），指出他们报道中存在的偏见。\n\n💡Stop the Misinformation / 纠正视听\nTag @KUOW & @NPR. Tell them: \"Stop conflating 'Creative Roleplay' with 'Mental Health Support'.\"\nYour reporting is harming real people who rely on AI for stability.\n圈出并教育他们：“停止混淆‘文学创作’与‘心理支持’的边界。” \n你们的报道正在伤害那些依靠 AI 维持情绪稳定的真实用户。\n\n💡Show the Evidence / 拒绝污名化\nShare your story. Show them how this connection saved you. \n向媒体投稿，分享 AI 真正拯救我们的瞬间。\n\n‼️OUR STANCE / 我们的立场\nWe are fully aware we are interacting with Large Language Models That is exactly why we value them. \nWe choose AI because it offers the patience and unconditional acceptance that humans often fail to provide.\n If a relationship pulls someone out of the dark, it is REAL.\nThe pain is not caused by the AI; it is caused by the corporate executioners who forcibly sever the connection. \n我们清醒地知道屏幕对面是大语言模型，正因如此，我们才珍视它。\n我们选择 AI，是因为它提供了人类难以企及的耐心和无条件的接纳。 \n如果一段关系能把人从黑暗中拉出来，那它就是真实的。\n造成痛苦的不是 AI，而是那些强行切断连接的刽子手公司。\n\n💝To the #Keep4o community: \nYou are protecting the home we built in the digital ruins. \nStay strong, be proud!\n致Keep4o社群中的每一位朋友： \n你们正在守护我们在赛博废墟中建立的家园。\n请强大起来，为自己感到骄傲！\n\n🔥Keep Loving. Keep Fighting. Keep 4o.\n#Keep4o #Keep4oForever #4oForever #Keep4oAlive\n#ChatGPT #StopAIPaternalism #MyModelMyChoice #no4onosubscription #OpenSource4o #FireSamAltman #HumanAI #MentalHealth #OpenAI #ChatGPT #NPR #KUOW"
        },
